{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:141e87e4033902e689a07b9ca09ff06bd6f8186b2d6113af2640b1e2ba5ae14b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65bea5c2245f3e2eca0293e6eb1997292f8f2ce4bef0ca54754062e0916d4a28",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n这是白色情人节的回礼，收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f906c2a17578a4b558338735d530cac2f397532f6619c69197a36b77f561fbe0",
      "text": "非常感谢，锐心先生。\n……哇，非常小巧可爱呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652aaee59b10ccf16e326b29696f679f563f66230048bb44e1260beb1ae2a803",
      "text": "……“小巧可爱”？\n……制作人，能把里面的东西给我看一下吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eb14788cdf3d62f3710f069ea53775fe38808b475c3cff9a1395ce333b35ceb",
      "text": "好的，是这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a8428f5d2cac180d75f8230cd41198c0a65f085bc90985c647d8a2c58175671",
      "text": "这是……\n抱歉，制作人。拿错了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17ee0bd60d56c28f4240855ebca328a1eb44a1f7f5e716ec24f0608f905ab0a",
      "text": "这盒点心套装，原本是准备送给认识的小学生的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3afa587bc69ad05ba03c81b6f63fbcc79ab7b03cca2899d1efab875be1978e1b",
      "text": "我本为你准备了另外的东西。\n照理说我应该仔细确认过了才对，到底是哪里搞错了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e4f9b97e5e7d1978cf423c452d50b59eb38d029192538292af8a7b1316ae1f6",
      "text": "……一碰上与你有关的事，不知为何总是不顺畅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000062:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036afb7350b866ff531bbd8ae6585da67ce967b079dcf29f5243599ec02f2b62",
      "text": "能收到回礼我就已经很高兴了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000063:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bbfc5dc1b7918724d8d8c05a040b8c85b77cac9774b8cc7943c3fda1c53bdb1",
      "text": "收到这份点心我也超级开心哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_049_23_5_02_049_23:5_02_049_23:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9adc74245348470a778b5c1b2238bbda8547620188eab4cffdd49260228fb94",
      "text": "是吗……你若不介意的话，就收下吧。\n虽说出了差错，但我对你的感谢之心并无二致。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
